OL,3,AUkraine's power supply close to
OL,4,Acritical as Russian strikes bring
OL,5,Adarkness and cold
OL,6,
OL,7,F"The last few days it was only four or
OL,8,Ffive hours we had power, but it's not
OL,9,Fat the same times. For two hours we
OL,10,Fhave electricity, then for eight hours
OL,11,Fwe don't."
OL,13,FThis rolling schedule of planned power
OL,14,Fcuts has been in place since October,
OL,15,Fas Russia intensified attacks on
OL,16,FUkraine's energy grid. Ukraine has
OL,17,Fresponded by striking Russian oil
OL,18,Frefineries.
